N:For Ithica Polka Quadrille, Fig 3 2X40
H:This is an English Folk Song found in print c.1850
H:but with lyrics dating back to at least 1787
H:Older versions
H: - O'Neill's, "O'Neill's Music of Ireland", v.9, No 1676, (1903) as "Early in the Morning"
H: - O'Neill's "Dance Music of Ireland", No 884, (1907) as "Early in the Morning"
